    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strike Force 2 - Terrorist Hunt Enhanced Edition</strong> is out now  \u2013 and it's a\u00a0<strong>FREE update</strong>!  Experience reworked levels with improved foliage, lighting, and water, plus enhanced rendering and overhauled AI. Get ready for the ultimate tactical shooter upgrade!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A tropical paradise turned into a warzone \u2013 now more immersive than ever!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One of our agents was on a mission to investigate a <strong>paramilitarized terrorist organization</strong> led by a former German secret service agent. We lost his tracking signal. The last message we received contained his <strong>coordinates and a request for extraction</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a member of the <strong>elite Strike Force Unit</strong>, your mission is clear: <strong>Rescue our agent and take down the terrorist threat.</strong> Gear up with an arsenal of <strong>modern weapons</strong> and fight your way through hostile environments in this intense tactical FPS.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enhanced Edition Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25ba <strong>Massively improved visuals</strong> \u2013 enhanced lighting, shadows, water, and foliage for an ultra-immersive experience.<br>\u25ba <strong>Reworked levels</strong> \u2013 improved environments, making every mission feel more alive.<br>\u25ba <strong>Overhauled AI</strong> \u2013 smarter enemies provide a more dynamic and challenging fight.<br>\u25ba <strong>PANet integration</strong> \u2013 unlock achievements and track stats on <strong></strong>.<br>\u25ba <strong>Refined gunplay</strong> \u2013 updated weapon models, improved animations, and better handling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25ba <strong>A tropical paradise turned warzone</strong> \u2013 explore <strong>exotic locations, dense jungles, and claustrophobic bunkers</strong>.<br>\u25ba <strong>Thrilling 8-mission campaign</strong> \u2013 fight to protect the free world.<br>\u25ba <strong>Diverse modern arsenal</strong> \u2013 wield machine guns, assault rifles, sniper rifles, and pistols.<br>\u25ba <strong>Dual Render Scopes</strong> \u2013 experience realistic sniper gameplay.<br>\u25ba <strong>NVIDIA DLSS support</strong> \u2013 enhanced performance for smoother gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you already own Strike Force 2 - Terrorist Hunt, the Enhanced Edition is a FREE update!</strong> Dive into the action now!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A tropical paradise turned into a warzone \u2013 now more immersive than ever!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One of our agents was on a mission to investigate a <strong>paramilitarized terrorist organization</strong> led by a former German secret service agent. We lost his tracking signal. The last message we received contained his <strong>coordinates and a request for extraction</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a member of the <strong>elite Strike Force Unit</strong>, your mission is clear: <strong>Rescue our agent and take down the terrorist threat.</strong> Gear up with an arsenal of <strong>modern weapons</strong> and fight your way through hostile environments in this intense tactical FPS.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enhanced Edition Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25ba <strong>Massively improved visuals</strong> \u2013 enhanced lighting, shadows, water, and foliage for an ultra-immersive experience.<br>\u25ba <strong>Reworked levels</strong> \u2013 improved environments, making every mission feel more alive.<br>\u25ba <strong>Overhauled AI</strong> \u2013 smarter enemies provide a more dynamic and challenging fight.<br>\u25ba <strong>PANet integration</strong> \u2013 unlock achievements and track stats on <strong></strong>.<br>\u25ba <strong>Refined gunplay</strong> \u2013 updated weapon models, improved animations, and better handling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25ba <strong>A tropical paradise turned warzone</strong> \u2013 explore <strong>exotic locations, dense jungles, and claustrophobic bunkers</strong>.<br>\u25ba <strong>Thrilling 8-mission campaign</strong> \u2013 fight to protect the free world.<br>\u25ba <strong>Diverse modern arsenal</strong> \u2013 wield machine guns, assault rifles, sniper rifles, and pistols.<br>\u25ba <strong>Dual Render Scopes</strong> \u2013 experience realistic sniper gameplay.<br>\u25ba <strong>NVIDIA DLSS support</strong> \u2013 enhanced performance for smoother gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you already own Strike Force 2 - Terrorist Hunt, the Enhanced Edition is a FREE update!</strong> Dive into the action now!</p>",
